{
  "name": "Create daily inactive repurchase campaign",
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "description": "Daily Voltou orchestrator: logs into the API, checks store send window, then creates an 'inativos' campaign for the test store so messages land in the approval queue. Why: recover inactive customers on follow-up timing without sending WhatsApp from n8n directly."
  },
  "tags": [
    { "name": "voltou" },
    { "name": "vendedor" },
    { "name": "campanha" }
  ],
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "timezone": "America/Sao_Paulo"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (once)\n1. Create credential **Basic Auth** named `Voltou API Login`\n   - User = email da loja de teste\n   - Password = senha\n2. Open node **Login Voltou API** → select that credential\n3. Run once with **When clicking Test** before activating the schedule\n4. Confirm campaign appears in `/painel/campanhas` (fila de aprovação)\n\nSecrets stay in the credential — not in this JSON.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-setup",
      "name": "Setup notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-480, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Why this shape\nOrquestrador: n8n only creates the campaign via `POST /campaigns`. WAHA send + opt-out + approval stay in voltou-api / painel.\n\n`autoApprove` off on purpose for the first ship.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-why",
      "name": "Design notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-480, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "manual-trigger",
      "name": "When clicking Test",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 9 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "schedule-trigger",
      "name": "Every day at 09:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [0, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "tenantId",
              "value": "737f45a3-bda3-4eda-8612-ac2ef5d1eb41",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "storeId",
              "value": "bbf60634-eecc-4aeb-84a2-3318cd7d1239",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a3",
              "name": "apiBase",
              "value": "https://api.voltouapp.com",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a4",
              "name": "messageTemplate",
              "value": "Oi {{nome}}! Faz um tempinho que você não aparece por aqui. Separei algo em {{produto}} pra você — se quiser, te mando o link {{link}}. Posso te ajudar?",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a5",
              "name": "campaignName",
              "value": "={{ 'Recompra inativos ' + $now.setZone('America/Sao_Paulo').toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a6",
              "name": "segment",
              "value": "inativos",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-context",
      "name": "Set store context",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [280, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Set store context').item.json.apiBase }}/auth/login",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpBasicAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ email: $credentials.user, password: $credentials.password }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": false
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "login",
      "name": "Login Voltou API",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [560, 100],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "notes": "Create Basic Auth credential named Voltou API Login (user=email, password=senha) and select it on this node after import. Body reads $credentials.user / $credentials.password."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $('Set store context').item.json.apiBase }}/stores/rules",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "tenantId",
              "value": "={{ $('Set store context').item.json.tenantId }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "storeId",
              "value": "={{ $('Set store context').item.json.storeId }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "={{ 'Bearer ' + $('Login Voltou API').item.json.accessToken }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "get-rules",
      "name": "Fetch store rules",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [840, 100],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "in-window",
              "leftValue": "={{ (() => {\n  const rules = $json.rules || {};\n  const now = $now.setZone('America/Sao_Paulo');\n  const dayMap = { 1: 'Seg', 2: 'Ter', 3: 'Qua', 4: 'Qui', 5: 'Sex', 6: 'Sáb', 7: 'Dom' };\n  const day = dayMap[now.weekday];\n  const dias = Array.isArray(rules.diasAtivos) ? rules.diasAtivos : [];\n  if (dias.length && !dias.includes(day)) return false;\n  const start = rules.horaInicio || '00:00';\n  const end = rules.horaFim || '23:59';\n  const cur = now.toFormat('HH:mm');\n  return cur >= start && cur <= end;\n})() }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-window",
      "name": "Inside store send window?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1120, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "s1",
              "name": "skipped",
              "value": true,
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "id": "s2",
              "name": "reason",
              "value": "outside_store_send_window",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "skip-window",
      "name": "Skip outside window",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1400, 280]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Set store context').item.json.apiBase }}/campaigns",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "={{ 'Bearer ' + $('Login Voltou API').item.json.accessToken }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ tenantId: $('Set store context').item.json.tenantId, storeId: $('Set store context').item.json.storeId, name: $('Set store context').item.json.campaignName, segment: $('Set store context').item.json.segment, messageTemplate: $('Set store context').item.json.messageTemplate }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "create-campaign",
      "name": "Create inactive campaign",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1400, 0],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "notes": "Creates outreach in pending_approval. Backend enforces opt-out / readyToContact."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "r1",
              "name": "ok",
              "value": true,
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "id": "r2",
              "name": "campaignId",
              "value": "={{ $json.id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "r3",
              "name": "messagesCreated",
              "value": "={{ $json.messagesCreated }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "r4",
              "name": "campaignName",
              "value": "={{ $('Set store context').item.json.campaignName }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "r5",
              "name": "tenantId",
              "value": "={{ $('Set store context').item.json.tenantId }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "r6",
              "name": "storeId",
              "value": "={{ $('Set store context').item.json.storeId }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-result",
      "name": "Summarize result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1680, 0]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "When clicking Test": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Set store context", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Every day at 09:00": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Set store context", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Set store context": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Login Voltou API", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Login Voltou API": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Fetch store rules", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Fetch store rules": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Inside store send window?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Inside store send window?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Create inactive campaign", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Skip outside window", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Create inactive campaign": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Summarize result", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  }
}
